timelinejs-react-skins
======================

This project is a fork of TimelineJS3 by Northwestern University Knight Lab,
originally licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0:

    https://github.com/NUKnightLab/TimelineJS3

The fork retains the MPL-2.0 license (see LICENSE) and adds three React-based
rendering "skins" (Archive, Cinematic, Editorial) layered on top of the
existing data pipeline (Google Sheets / CSV / JSON loading, TimelineConfig,
MediaType detection, i18n).

